nges","slug":"delivery-challenges","lessonDuration":8,"topic":{"title":"Deliver"}},{"id":"e4243bb2-1539-5d1c-aa9a-4d04701412e6","title":"Feature Flags for Mobile App Product Managers","slug":"feature-flags","lessonDuration":9,"topic":{"title":"Deliver"}},{"id":"0e14e7ec-ff5a-53d7-ac1f-9a23dd22103e","title":"The Complete Release Plan Framework","slug":"release-plan-framework","lessonDuration":9,"topic":{"title":"Deliver"}},{"id":"5d77b082-4634-5446-b84b-98a37ea43f28","title":"What to Measure","slug":"what-to-measure","lessonDuration":3,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"1db25fa8-3862-5751-bd77-c4b0fb62223b","title":"How to Set Up Mobile App Tracking","slug":"how-to-set-up-mobile-app-tracking","lessonDuration":10,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"cd52ad89-e869-59d6-9da6-a78af5cc8a7b","title":"Methodology: How to Measure ","slug":"methodology-how-to-measure","lessonDuration":7,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"0c2bafff-2456-5025-9feb-a11190a2f41d","title":"Measuring Experiments","slug":"measuring-experiments","lessonDuration":4,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"dab5e7e2-1bbf-5fc8-a5cf-981b047d379e","title":"Analytics Pitfalls","slug":"analytics-pitfalls","lessonDuration":6,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"32665899-bf61-5808-b8ae-e8d8af085100","title":"Tracking Cadence","slug":"tracking-cadence","lessonDuration":3,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}},{"id":"ca5639ad-e8a2-5c4a-b191-3aab3baa0b83","title":"The Last Step: Get Your Mobile PM Certificate","slug":"the-last-step","lessonDuration":1,"topic":{"title":"Measure"}}]},"contentfulLesson":{"id":"041a4571-ae41-5b06-b2e6-a114984bb940","title":"Shape Up framework 2 - Shaping","description":"Learn why shaping matters in product development and how to use breadboarding and fat marker sketches to ideate and refine solutions.","slug":"shape-up-framework-2-shaping","lessonDescription":{"raw":"{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"This lesson discusses the importance of shaping in product development, and how to use the techniques of breadboarding and fat marker sketches to ideate and refine solutions.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"sys\":{\"id\":\"47Px3xKG2H9uYbkGxkHTqy\",\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"Asset\"}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-asset-block\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"Key takeaways:\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Shaping is the process of defining and refining high-level aspects of a project with a group of senior team members before it's handed off to a team for development.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"A well-defined scope helps to avoid scope creep, ensuring that efforts are focused and purposeful.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Breadboarding is a technique for mapping out the user's journey across an app by identifying places, affordances, and connections.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Fat marker sketches are a way to create a visual concept without getting bogged down by intricate details.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Both breadboarding and fat marker sketches can be used to explore multiple approaches to a problem and refine ideas quickly and efficiently.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"}","references":[{"contentful_id":"47Px3xKG2H9uYbkGxkHTqy","title":"Breadboarding","description":"","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/47Px3xKG2H9uYbkGxkHTqy/cde7de88c71f03da8e392260657e8c98/Screenshot_2024-03-02_at_12.10.18.png","details":{"image":{"width":1206,"height":530}}}}]},"topic":{"title":"Discover"},"lessonDuration":9,"vimeoId":"883745241?h=8426e5452c","thumbnail":{"__typename":"ContentfulAsset","id":"b7e807ff-aba6-5f6e-995c-5b56e36146e5","title":"Group 7996","altDescription":"","gatsbyImageData":{"images":{"sources":[{"srcSet":"https://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=480&h=270&q=80&fm=webp 480w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=768&h=431&q=80&fm=webp 768w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=1024&h=575&q=80&fm=webp 1024w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=1200&h=674&q=80&fm=webp 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw","type":"image/webp"},{"srcSet":"https://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=480&h=270&q=80&fm=avif 480w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=768&h=431&q=80&fm=avif 768w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05/Group_7996-min.png?w=1024&h=575&q=80&fm=avif 1024w,\nhttps://images.ctfassets.net/vv1yxl437u7d/42HWKJ4chi8I5hid1vlbXu/65df7e212f7c631e902677080b15bc05